hit the elephant on e7, working with my cannon on i7. - **Safety:** no black
piece attacks d4. - **What I expect back:** - The black rook may go to c1. It
would then hit my elephant on c0 and my pawn on c4. I can answer by moving the
elephant to e2, taking on c6, or putting a cannon on c2 to block the file. -
The rook may go to b2 and chase my cannon on a2. I can pull the cannon back to
a1. 便条: 马c2已进d4，威胁吃c6卒(无保护)，之后可攻e7象(c9象保护)。
